, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn7le01ob01re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Make a list of New Year's resolutions."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn7le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn7le01ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can't believe the Christmas holidays are over! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I know what you mean. This time of year always makes me want to start new things. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't like to make New Year's resolutions. I can never stick to them for more than a couple of weeks."}, {"time": "14200", "image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Come on! What about taking up a new sport? I'm going to join a fitness club. You should come, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Do you know which one you'll go to? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: There's a new gym right by my office. They offer pilates, zumba and kickboxing classes. They have a free trial period. I think I'll try everything.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't you think that sounds a bit too intense?"}, {"time": "36100", "image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        It beats staying at home and surfing the web all night! You should spend less time on the computer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    It's hard to keep in touch with people without it. I rely on social media to get online buzz about the restaurant. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Can you remember the last time you spent a day without looking at a screen? Physical activities will do you good, trust me.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Alright, I'll make an effort.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         The new year is going to be awesome!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Hanging out with Friends"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Making Plans"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "  Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Questions with Sentences / Asking for Clarification"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense ?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification. Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you know which fitness club you'll go to? (question with sentence)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense? (asking for clarification)"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use two different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li><li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think I'll try everything.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm going to join a fitness club.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "resolution"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a decision you make and that you want to keep"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't like to make New Year's resolutions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about social activities or to make plans."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to stick to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to continue doing something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can never stick to my resolutions for more than two weeks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fitness "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the condition of being physically fit and healthy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to join a fitness club."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "zumba"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a physical activity involving dance movements, usually performed to Latin American music"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to try a new zumba class."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kickboxing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a self-defence discipline that combines kicking and punching"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They offer kickboxing lessons as well."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "free trial period"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period of time during which you can try a service for free"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The fitness club has a free trial period."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to surf the web"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go on the Internet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Dancing beats staying at home and surfing the web for hours."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rely on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to place trust on something or someone; to depend on"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I rely on social media to advertise my restaurant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "online buzz"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the attention that something or someone gets online"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I rely on social media to get online buzz about the restaurant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le01ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ask 8 people you know about their plans for the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them if they like to make New Year's resolutions and if they usually stick to them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the resolutions in the chart below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your answers with your partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Person\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Resolutions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do they stick to them?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about future actions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for clarification about plans in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about social activities."}]}]}